abstract: >-
  Executable recursive ordinal notation systems in Lean 4. Version 0.1.0
  provides a verified Cantor-normal-form notation system whose canonical
  terms represent exactly the ordinals below epsilon zero.
keywords:
  - "ordinal analysis"
  - "proof theory"
  - "epsilon zero"
  - "ordinal notation"
  - "Cantor normal form"
  - "Lean 4"
  - "mathlib"
  - "formal verification"
